===Verb===
{{en-verb|*}}

# {{&lit|en|back|into}}
# {{lb|en|sports|idiomatic}} To [[advance]] to the [[post-season]] as a result of another [[team]]'s [[loss]], especially where one's own team has also lost.
#: ''The 2006 St. Louis Cardinals '''backed into''' the playoffs.''
# {{lb|en|sports|idiomatic}} To be forced into a situation by circumstances.

